WEBVTT

00:15:28.674 --> 00:15:31.593
and I wanted to show us
just another piece of your work.

00:15:33.136 --> 00:15:34.888
JR: Oh yeah, that was in Ukraine.

00:15:35.389 --> 00:15:38.308
The biggest city in the west side
of Ukraine is called Lviv.

00:15:38.725 --> 00:15:42.729
And a friend of mine
took that photo at the border,

00:15:42.771 --> 00:15:45.607
he sent it to me,
I printed it 150 feet long.

00:15:45.607 --> 00:15:49.528
We rolled it as a tarp,
walked through the border with it.

00:15:49.528 --> 00:15:52.447
It's actually easy to go that way,
you know, to enter Ukraine.

00:15:52.489 --> 00:15:55.367
So they were like, "Oh, you're
going to go this way? Sure."

00:15:55.409 --> 00:15:59.246
And then we drove to, you know,
I met some people on Instagram,

00:15:59.246 --> 00:16:01.415
and they came
and picked me up in their car.